# Repository-root .dockerignore (2026-09-01, added alongside the
# MitateDB-api/docker/Dockerfile build-context fix, m-1 review finding).
#
# MitateDB-api/docker/Dockerfile now builds with the REPOSITORY ROOT as
# build context (needed to reach `spec/data-service-api.v1.json`, which
# lives outside `MitateDB-api/` -- see that Dockerfile's own BUILD CONTEXT
# comment). Without this file, `docker build` sends the entire repo root to
# the daemon on every build, including `.venv/` (~64MB) and `.git/`
# (~17MB) -- neither of which any COPY instruction in the Dockerfile ever
# references.

.git/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.log
node_modules/
.claude/
